Data from Open Food Facts (https://world.openfoodfacts.org), obtained from the
openfoodfacts/product-database export on Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/openfoodfacts/product-database).

The data files in this directory (tree.json, records.csv, holdout.csv) are a derived
extract of that database. They are made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The individual contents of the database are made available under the
Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

Suggested attribution: "Contains data from Open Food Facts, available under the
Open Database License."

If you publish or share a derived database, the ODbL share-alike terms apply.
Check the Open Food Facts terms of use before you publish anything derived from this data:
https://world.openfoodfacts.org/terms-of-use

The MIT licence of the rest of this repository does not apply to these data files.
The script prepare_data.py is code, not data, and is under the repository's MIT licence.
